{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"MoravaK-理论"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“Morava K-理论”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于素数 $p$, Morava K-理论是一列复定向上同调理论 $K(n)$,\n$$\r\n\\pi_\\bullet(K(n))\\simeq\\mathbb F_p[v_n,v_n^{-1}],\r\n$$\n其中 $v_n$ 的阶数为 $2(p^n-1)$.</p>\n<p>$K(n)$ 具有 $MU_{(p)}$-"},{"Local":{"url":"A∞-代数","text":"A∞-代数"}},{"Plain":"结构.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"MU","text":"MU"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}